{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"EZK","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"以西結書","commonName":"以西結書","title":"以西結書","order":26,"numberOfChapters":48,"sha256":"12baf83f738d213fc8fcfdfb80ed9077bac361d38fc0165824d98cb7b59e53b9","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/1.json","lastChapterNumber":48,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/48.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1270},"chapter":{"number":30,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華要懲罰埃及"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和華的話又臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["「人子啊，你要發預言說，主耶和華如此說：",{"text":"哀哉這日！你們應當哭號。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華的日子臨近，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是密雲之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"列國受罰之期。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必有刀劍臨到埃及；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在埃及被殺之人仆倒的時候，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"古實人就有痛苦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人民必被擄掠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"基址必被拆毀。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["古實人、弗人",{"noteId":29},"、路德人、雜族的人民，並古巴人，以及同盟之地的人都要與埃及人一同倒在刀下。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"扶助埃及的也必傾倒。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及因勢力而有的驕傲必降低微；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的人民，從色弗尼塔起","poem":1},{"noteId":30},{"text":"必倒在刀下。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是主耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及地在荒涼的國中必成為荒涼；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"埃及城在荒廢的城中也變為荒廢。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在埃及中使火着起；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"幫助埃及的，都被滅絕。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，他們就知道我是耶和華。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["「到那日，必有使者坐船，從我面前出去，使安逸無慮的古實人驚懼；必有痛苦臨到他們，好像埃及遭災的日子一樣。看哪，這事臨近了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"主耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必藉巴比倫王尼布甲尼撒的手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除滅埃及眾人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他和隨從他的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是列國中強暴的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必進來毀滅這地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們必拔刀攻擊埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使遍地有被殺的人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使江河乾涸，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將地賣在惡人的手中；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必藉外邦人的手，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使這地和其中所有的變為淒涼。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是我－耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"主耶和華如此說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必毀滅偶像，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從挪弗除滅神像；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必不再有君王出自埃及地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使埃及地的人懼怕。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必使巴忒羅荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在瑣安中使火着起，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"向挪施行審判。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必將我的忿怒倒在埃及的保障上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就是訓上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"並要剪除挪的眾人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必在埃及中使火着起；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"訓必大大痛苦；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪必被攻破；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"挪弗白日","poem":1},{"noteId":31},{"text":"見仇敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亞文和比伯實的少年人必倒在刀下；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這些城的人必被擄掠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我在答比匿折斷埃及的諸軛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她因勢力而有的驕傲在其中止息。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，日光必退去；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"至於這城，必有密雲遮蔽，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"其中的女子必被擄掠。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必這樣向埃及施行審判，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們就知道我是耶和華。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["埃及王破碎的力量"]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":["十一年正月初七日，耶和華的話臨到我說："]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":["「人子啊，我已打折埃及王法老的膀臂；沒有敷藥，也沒有用布纏好，使他有力持刀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":["所以主耶和華如此說：看哪，我與埃及王法老為敵，必將他有力的膀臂和已打折的膀臂全行打斷，使刀從他手中墜落。"]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":["我必將埃及人分散在列國，四散在列邦。"]},{"type":"verse","number":24,"content":["我必使巴比倫王的膀臂有力，將我的刀交在他手中；卻要打斷法老的膀臂，他就在巴比倫王面前唉哼，如同受死傷的人一樣。"]},{"type":"verse","number":25,"content":["我必扶持巴比倫王的膀臂，法老的膀臂卻要下垂；我將我的刀交在巴比倫王手中，他必舉刀攻擊埃及地，他們就知道我是耶和華。"]},{"type":"verse","number":26,"content":["我必將埃及人分散在列國，四散在列邦；他們就知道我是耶和華。」"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":29,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：利比亞","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":5}},{"noteId":30,"caller":"-","text":"見二十九章十節","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":6}},{"noteId":31,"caller":"-","text":"或譯：終日","reference":{"chapter":30,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/30.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/31.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/EZK/29.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":26}